+
+    <div style="grid-column: span 6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
+      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #122640; padding-bottom: 8px;">What changes from the phone</p>
