+        <b>Fewer screens</b><span>Language and “say it your way” share one screen. Plan and “take it with you” share another.</span>
+        <b>Two columns</b><span>Task on the left, help on the right, each with one left edge. Nothing centers but button labels. Stacks under 1024 px.</span>
+        <b>Print first</b><span>The main action on the plan is PRINT MY PLAN. A text goes only to a number they give staff.</span>
+        <b>Bigger type</b><span>Body 20 px, questions 40 px. People sit farther from a monitor.</span>
+        <b>Keyboard works</b><span>Tab through every control. Enter makes the plan. Esc is Quick exit on a safety screen.</span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div style="grid-column: span 12; background: #122640; color: #ffffff; padding: 22px 26px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
