+        <b style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #facc0a;">Start over, always</b>
+        <span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">A button in the top bar on every screen. It clears the words, the taps and the plan.</span>
+      </div>
+      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
+        <b style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #facc0a;">Clears itself</b>
+        <span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">After 3 quiet minutes, a 30-second warning, then everything is wiped.</span>
