+        <b style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #facc0a;">Safety is stricter</b>
+        <span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">Someone may be standing behind them. No printout on a safety path, and Quick exit is one key.</span>
