+          <li><b>Top bar:</b> logo on the left; language and START OVER on the right. Back sits above the question.</li>
+          <li><b>Task column:</b> one question, the input, one yellow action.</li>
+          <li><b>Help column</b> in sand: how it works, why a door fits, what we never ask.</li>
+        </ol>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div style="grid-column: span 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
+      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #122640; padding-bottom: 8px;">Same as the phone</p>
+      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 0; list-style-position: outside; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
+        <li>Safety check runs before any search.</li>
+        <li>Every fact shows its check date and source.</li>
+        <li>“Likely a fit”, never “you qualify”.</li>
+        <li>A care manager approves before anything prints.</li>
