+        <span><b>Likely, never sure.</b> “Likely a fit. Not a promise.” Never “you qualify.”</span>
+        <span><b>Sourced.</b> Every phone, hour and rule shows its check date and source.</span>
+        <span><b>Unknown says so.</b> No hours listed? “Ask about hours when you call.”</span>
+        <span><b>Their words first.</b> Spanish on top, English below for staff, on the printout only.</span>
+        <span><b>No pity.</b> Say “people”, not “clients” or “the homeless”. No exclamation marks.</span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div style="grid-column: span 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
+      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #122640; padding-bottom: 8px;">How sure is this fact</p>
+      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; font-size: 14px;">
+        <span style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #122640; border: 1.5px solid #122640; flex-shrink: 0;"></span><b>Checked Oct 13</b><span style="color: #33373d;">High confidence. Shown as is.</span></span>
+        <span style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border: 1.5px solid #122640; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex;"><span style="width: 50%; background: #122640;"></span></span><b>Call to confirm</b><span style="color: #33373d;">Medium. Says so on the card.</span></span>
+        <span style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border: 1.5px dashed #122640; flex-shrink: 0;"></span><b>Unsure, call first</b><span style="color: #33373d;">Low. Backup only, never the door.</span></span>
+        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #33373d; line-height: 1.5;">Shape carries the meaning, not color, so it reads in print and for color-blind readers.</span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div style="grid-column: span 12; background: #122640; color: #ffffff; padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center;">
+      <b style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #facc0a; flex-shrink: 0;">Never</b>
+      <span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">show a shelter address on a safety path · answer a medicine question · invent a phone, hour or rule · send a message for the person · ask for a name, ID number or immigration status.</span>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</div>
