+      <div class="phase now"><span class="when">Today</span><h3>Working prototype</h3><ul><li>5 screens on the 40 checked listings, in the IHH design system</li><li>Guardrails: no invented facts, safety stop, medical redirect</li><li>Safety exit, gap state and Spanish plan card</li><li>Gaps view from 12 sample clients</li></ul><div class="gate"><b>Decision</b>Is this worth a 4-week pilot?</div></div>
