+      <div class="phase"><span class="when">Months 2–3</span><h3>Close the loop</h3><ul><li>Record follow-up: did the client reach the door?</li><li>Monthly gaps report to leadership</li><li>Wider directory through the national 211 API, with permission</li><li>Re-verify listings on a set schedule</li></ul><div class="gate"><b>Decision</b>Which gap do we fund or partner on first?</div></div>
